y of things, such as creating a brand, setting goals, developing content, selecting the right platform, and whatnot.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here are the 11 key steps that you must&nbsp;adhere&nbsp;to&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure you make the most of your marketing process.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Define a Brand&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create a Buyer Persona&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Establish Marketing Goals&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Evaluate Available Digital Marketing Channels&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Define Your Marketing Strategy&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Conduct Competitor Analysis&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Set a Budget for your Campaign&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use the Right Tools and Technologies&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bring the Campaign Together&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Track and Measure Results&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Take Corrective Measures&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/process-of-digital-marketing.webp\" alt=\"The Process of\u00a0Digital Marketing:\u00a011 Steps to Follow\" class=\"wp-image-20351\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/process-of-digital-marketing.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/process-of-digital-marketing-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/process-of-digital-marketing-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/process-of-digital-marketing-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/process-of-digital-marketing-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Define a Brand<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The&nbsp;first step of&nbsp;digital&nbsp;marketing process&nbsp;is creating a brand that you want to promote in the market. This is not only about starting a website or business but also about defining why your brand is unique and what you offer that your competitors&nbsp;don\u2019t.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You need to stand out to get the audience\u2019s attention and market your product or service. For example, many e-commerce stores are now selling environmentally friendly clothes and shoes. Their unique selling point (USP) is that they are sustainable clothing brands.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Similarly, you need a USP to convince people to prefer your brand and buy your products. Your USP will enhance your brand image and reputation, making potential customers more confident about buying from you.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is also the stage where you decide on your brand\u2019s voice, tone, and mission. What&nbsp;you are&nbsp;doing and why?&nbsp;What is the motivation behind starting this particular business?&nbsp;What value do you provide to your customers? Do you have a purpose?&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some brands&nbsp;make a donation, like sponsoring a child\u2019s education or providing&nbsp;basic necessities, each time somebody buys their products. When you have a motive, people connect with your brand and want to contribute their best. So, make sure to define your brand and state what makes you different from others.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Create a Buyer Persona<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Digital marketing is continuously evolving, and so are people\u2019s interests. You can create the best content, sharing benefits that your business offers. However, you&nbsp;can\u2019t&nbsp;engage people if they&nbsp;don\u2019t&nbsp;need your product. When you dig deeper to uncover the interests, needs, preferences, and challenges of your target audience, you make more&nbsp;impact.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Therefore, start by understanding your audience, which goes beyond basic demographics. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/buyer-persona\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Buyer personas<\/a>, also known as ideal customer profiles, represent your potential consumers and are created through research, surveys, and interviews. It is the foundation of a powerful <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-strategy\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing strategy<\/a> as it tells you about the people you want to reach and sell your products to.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Buyer personas are detailed characterizations based on diverse data points and meaningful insights. It involves a comprehensive study of their behaviors, preferences, and pain points.&nbsp;It\u2019s&nbsp;important to collect real and&nbsp;accurate&nbsp;data to&nbsp;identify&nbsp;these three key personas so you can adopt a more targeted marketing approach.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Any assumptions made while defining buyer personas can lead to the failure of your marketing campaign. To get a more&nbsp;accurate&nbsp;and well-rounded picture of personas, you must include prospects and customers whose traits align with your target audience.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your research must uncover demographic information, such as location, age, income, job title, and psychographic information (hobbies, goals, priorities, and challenges).&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3.&nbsp;Establish&nbsp;Marketing Goals<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Now that you have defined your brand and studied your&nbsp;audience&nbsp;work on one of the essential&nbsp;digital marketing process steps&nbsp;establishing&nbsp;clear and achievable goals. Having precise and measurable goals is the cornerstone of any marketing strategy, as it helps you pave the right path toward your&nbsp;objectives&nbsp;and directs your actions.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Every step and plan must work toward your goals. Make sure to avoid vague targets and keep them attainable and specific.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For this, you can develop a SMART goals framework, which means goals should be specific, measurable, attainable, relevant, and&nbsp;timely.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example,&nbsp;don\u2019t&nbsp;set a generic goal like \u2018achieving higher ranks\u2019 or \u2018increasing conversions.\u2019 Be more specific and define clear goals, like&nbsp;optimizing&nbsp;content and website within the next&nbsp;30 days&nbsp;to increase traffic by 20% and boost conversion by 10% by the end of the quarter.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Also, your goals should be measurable so you can measure progress and ensure you are moving in the right direction.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/mas